Layout-Bench modifications: resolve the IHP binding into fixed device values;
add explicit physical substrate/well contacts; publish native LVS and simulator
representations with the same six MOS devices; independently construct the
reference layout. The maintained testbench is separately identified as MIT.
Retain these notices and LICENSE with distributions of these materials.

