amp_003_fan_smc: CODA-Team AnalogGym BSD-3-Clause provenance from the same
fixed snapshot; normalized derivatives retain the database PolyForm terms
and Required Notice. Layout-Bench retains all 24 MOS groups and 412 physical
fingers, implements the single compensation branch with two physical MIM
units, preserves the source-tied input body in its own well and adds taps.
The external bias is deliberately changed from 60 uA to 3 uA for maintained
headroom. The independent witness and native loop/recovery deck do not imply
unchanged source bias or upstream performance targets.

amp_005_hoilee_affc and amp_010_peng_acbc: CODA-Team AnalogGym BSD-3-Clause
